            1371.183349609375,
            948.827392578125,
            1409.3018798828125
          ],
          "text": "This pattern is due to the dresser not being square with the grinding wheel. When\nthe grinding wheel is dressed it becomes tapered which causes uneven contact to\nthe work piece."
        },
